\title{CSolve: Verifying C with Liquid Types}
\taxon{Reference}
\tag{reviewed}
\date{2012}
\author{patrickrondon}
\author{alexander}
\author{mingkawaguchi}
\author{ranjitjhala}
\meta{venue}{[[cav2012]]}
\meta{doi}{10.1007/978-3-642-31424-7_59}
\p{We present CSolve, an automated verifier for C programs based on Liquid Type inference. We show how CSolve verifies memory safety through an example and describe its architecture and interface.}
